+6. Keep the two first candidates. Stream six fixed transported predecessors into each of two RHS arrays, recording each inherited first residual/transport error, sum error and center real-B error. This costs12 transport calls if no reuse is claimed. For each second solve, rho2 certifies against the actual stored RHS; add Berr exactly once before dividing by delta. Stream15 final transported second candidates and their envelopes, then divide by8 and add subnormal error. This adds15 transport calls. Preserve the global physical i separately. Never replace six vectors by class multiplicities alone.
