+8. Final exact particle-number scan covers every odd k=1,3,...,21 and the complete k>=3 projection, with the implicit parity bit counted. From candidate norm brackets and Echi report interval weights. A positive lower endpoint proves nonzero weight; a small upper bound is smallness only. No exact-zero or bulk hybridization claim follows. Preserve all checkpoints, residual bounds, partial vectors and failures; no replacement or pooling with prior experiments.
